        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michaël Llodra, Juan Martín del Potro, Novak Djokovic, Tomáš Berdych, Robin Söderling, Jo-Wilfried Tsonga, Nikolay Davydenko, Janko Tipsarević, John Isner\n- Organizations: Association of Tennis Professionals\n- Roles: professional tennis players, doubles player, singles player\n- Achievements: Grand Slam championships, Olympic silver medal, career titles, world rankings\n\nFacts:\n- Juan Martín del Potro was born on 23 September 1988.\n- Juan Martín del Potro is an Argentinian professional tennis player known as Delpo.\n- Juan Martín del Potro was ranked world No. 24 in men's singles by the Association of Tennis Professionals.\n- Michaël Llodra is a successful doubles player with three Grand Slam championships and an Olympic silver medal.\n- Michaël Llodra also had success in singles by winning five career titles.\n- Michaël Llodra earned singles victories over Novak Djokovic, Juan Martín del Potro, Tomáš Berdych, Robin Söderling, Jo-Wilfried Tsonga, Nikolay Davydenko, Janko Tipsarević, and John Isner.",
